{"meta":{"ph":"səˈpraɪz; NAmE sərˈpraɪz","pos":"noun","stars":""},"defs":[{"def":"an event, a piece of news, etc. that is unexpected or that happens suddenly 意想不到（或突然）的事；令人惊奇的事（或消息等）","ex":[{"s":"They provide shade, lower surface temperatures, absorb a surprising amount of airborne carbon, remove tiny pollutants, and provide wildlife habitat along with just plain beauty.","src":"2026新高考I卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"它们提供树荫、降低地表温度、吸收可观的空气中的碳、清除微小污染物，并提供野生动物栖息地，还有纯粹的美的享受。"},{"s":"Smart recommendation engines analyze data such as exhibit popularity and visitors’ past behavior to suggest specific exhibits and events, making each visit unique and surprising. _____37_____ These digital assistants engage visitors in dynamic conversations and offer context-sensitive insights that deepen understanding and satisfy curiosity.","src":"2026新高考I卷·七选五","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"智能推荐引擎分析数据,如展示受欢迎度和访客过去的行为,以建议具体的展品和活动,使每次访问都变得独特和____37____令人惊讶。 这些数字助理让游客进行动态对话,并提供对背景敏感的见解,加深理解,满足好奇心。"},{"s":"It went surprisingly well.","src":"2025新高考II卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"进展的很顺利"},{"s":"“Sometimes it surprises me that it works so well,” he says.","src":"2024新高考I卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"他说,“有时我感到惊讶的是,它的运作如此良好。”"},{"s":"Being new to the school made me even ____1____ , so it was surprising I’d ____2____ to anyone around me.","src":"2023北京卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"我对周围____1____的人感到____2____惊讶。"},{"s":"It may be, of course, that these characteristics aren’t in any way surprising or singular.","src":"2023北京卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"当然，这些特征可能在任何方面都不令人惊讶或独特。"},{"s":"Emerging research suggests that courses in lower-ranked universities, on average, scored higher on teaching than courses in higher-ranked universities. ____37____ The absence of teaching excellence from the rankings is surprising given the link between high-quality teaching and student success.","src":"2023北京卷·七选五","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"新兴研究显示,排名较低的大学的课程在教学上的平均得分高于排名较高的大学的课程,____37____鉴于高质量的教学和学生的成功之间的联系,排名中缺乏优秀的教学成果令人惊讶。"},{"s":"Surprisingly, children replied that they couldn’t.","src":"2022全国乙卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"儿童回答说,"},{"s":"To everyone`s surprising, the ball went into the net.","src":"2019全国I卷·短文改错","cat":"gaokao","year":2019,"t":"令大家惊讶的是，球进了网。"},{"s":"Most of us， in fact， progressively narrow the variety of our lives． We succeed in our field of specialization and then become trapped in it． Nothing surprises us． We lose our sense of wonder． But， if we are willing to learn， the opportunities are everywhere．","src":"2019天津卷·20．","cat":"gaokao","year":2019,"t":"事实上，我们大多数人逐渐收窄了生活的多样性。我们在专业领域取得成功，然后被困在其中。没什么能让我们惊讶。我们失去了惊奇感。但是，如果我们愿意学习，机会无处不在。"},{"s":"Jennifer DeBruyn, a microbiologist at the University of Tennessee, who was not involved in the study, says it is not surprising that such worms can break down polyethylene.","src":"2018北京卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"未参与该研究的田纳西大学微生物学家詹妮弗·德布鲁因说，这类蠕虫能分解聚乙烯并不令人惊讶。"},{"s":"“For example, most of us would expect older drivers always go slower than everyone else but surprisingly, we found that in 30mph zones they struggled to keep at a constant speed and so were more likely to break the speed limit and be at risk of getting fined.","src":"2017全国III卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"“例如，我们大多数人都以为老年驾驶者总是比其他人开得慢，但令人惊讶的是，我们发现，在限速30英里每小时的区域，他们难以保持匀速，因此更有可能超速并被罚款的风险。"},{"s":"It’s surprising how much simple movements of the body can affect the way we think.","src":"2017浙江11月卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"身体简单的动作能多大程度影响我们的思维，令人惊讶。"},{"s":"It was filled with surprises and amusements, all because of my mother---loving, sweet, yet absent-minded and forgetful.","src":"2017浙江11月卷·读后续写","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"它充满了惊喜和乐趣，全都是因为我的母亲——充满爱、甜美，却又心不在焉、健忘。"},{"s":"Around the world, people are adapting in surprising ways, especially in some poor countries.","src":"2017江苏卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"世界各地的人们正以惊人的方式适应，尤其在一些贫穷国家。"},{"s":"Father: (raising his voice in surprise) You can't be serious!","src":"外研社B1 U3","cat":"waiyan","t":"父亲: (提高他的声音惊奇) 你不能是认真的!"},{"s":"The middle part contains the \"meat\" of the story, with the ending being a summary, a powerful quote or even a surprise for the reader.","src":"外研社B1 U3","cat":"waiyan","t":"中间部分包含了故事的\"肉\",结尾是总结,有力引用甚至给读者带来惊喜."},{"s":"It was my mother's birthday ten years ago, and I decided to surprise her with home-made scrambled eggs.","src":"外研社B1 U3","cat":"waiyan","t":"十年前是我母亲的生日，我决定用自制炒蛋给她一个惊喜。"},{"s":"To my surprise she tasted them and said they weren't bad!","src":"外研社B1 U3","cat":"waiyan","t":"令我惊讶的是，她尝了尝，说它们不赖！"}]},{"def":"a feeling caused by sth happening suddenly or unexpectedly 惊奇；惊讶；意外","ex":[{"s":"His reply came as a surprise — a shock, actually: “Not a chance.” Clearly, he was unhappy over the way we had parted.","src":"2025新高考I卷·读后续写","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"他的回复令人意外——其实是震惊：“绝不可能。”显然，他对我们分开时的方式感到不快。"},{"s":"And in the process, I’ve experienced things that really surprise me at times.","src":"2025新高考II卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"在此过程中，我体验过有时真正让我惊讶的事。"},{"s":"The original reading was either forgotten or so totally absorbed that the new chance encounter with the text produced surprise and astonishment.","src":"2024天津3月卷·阅读Passage 2","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"最初的阅读要么已被遗忘，要么已被完全吸收，以至于再次与文本相遇时产生了惊喜与惊讶。"},{"s":"Still, sometimes our assumptions are incorrect, and scientific findings surprise researchers, along with the rest of us.","src":"2024天津3月卷·Passage 4","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"尽管如此，有时我们的假设是错误的，科学发现会让我们和其余人一样惊讶。"},{"s":"It’s a surprise they haven’t managed to grow square ones so that they can ___36___ them easily.","src":"2023全国甲卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"他们没有设法长出方____36____块,"},{"s":"The twins were filled with excitement as they thought of the surprise they were planning for Mother's Day.","src":"2021卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"双胞胎想到为母亲节策划的惊喜，充满兴奋。"},{"s":"The twins were filled with excitement as they thought of the surprise they were planning for Mother’s Day.","src":"2021新高考II卷·A MOTHER’S DAY SURPRISE","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"双胞胎想到为母亲节策划的惊喜，充满兴奋。"},{"s":"It seemed to go on forever!” So surprise your audience.","src":"2020全国新高考I卷·七选五","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"“似乎没完没了！”所以给你的听众惊喜。"},{"s":"Then one Christmas I received a surprise gift—a large, beautifully made wooden chest My son Bruce had made my Grandma's Box a reality.","src":"2020全国新高考II卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"后来有一年圣诞节，我收到一份惊喜礼物——一只大而精美的木箱。我儿子布鲁斯让我的“奶奶的箱子”变成了现实。"},{"s":"Parry quickly graduated from his early hearts and sharks, and started to surprise families with drawings that captured young patients’ personalities.","src":"2020天津3月卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"帕里很快从早期的心脏和鲨鱼进阶，开始用捕捉小患者个性的画给家属带来惊喜。"},{"s":"Mabry works circles around all the students， cleaning up messes others don't want to touch． He doesn't expect a lot． Mabry said he hadn't planned to do much for his milestone birthday，so he was happy the students had prepared the surprise celebration．","src":"2019天津卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2019,"t":"梅布里干活比所有学生都麻利，清理别人不愿碰的脏乱。他要求不多。梅布里说他没打算为这个里程碑式的生日大办，所以很高兴学生们准备了惊喜庆祝。"},{"s":"Much to the family’s surprise, Dennis stuck to his    52   !","src":"2018全国III卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"令人惊讶的是,丹尼斯坚持了52岁。"}]},{"def":"the use of methods that cause feelings of surprise 出人意表的做事方式；出奇制胜的策略","ex":[]},{"def":"（认为不足为怪时说）这有什么好奇怪的","ex":[{"s":"So for them to move to Elkhead, Colo. to instruct the children whose shoes were held together with string was a surprise.","src":"2022全国乙卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"因此，她们搬到科罗拉多州埃尔克黑德，去教那些鞋子用绳子绑在一起的孩子，令人意外。"},{"s":"Nature never ceases to surprise.","src":"2022天津4月卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"大自然从未停止过惊喜"},{"s":"Perhaps this is not a surprise.","src":"2021全国甲卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"也许这并不令人意外。"},{"s":"It is not surprising, then, that Macartney left China without negotiating the trade agreement.","src":"2018上海卷·Section B","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"因此，马戛尔尼离开中国时未能谈成贸易协定，也就不奇怪了。"}]},{"def":"（让某人感到意外时说）想不到吧","ex":[]},{"def":"to make sb feel surprised 使惊奇；使诧异；使感到意外","ex":[{"s":"“I am pleasantly surprised, because I am always looking for where to plug it in,” Espinoza said before catching the subway in a working-class area of southern Barcelona.","src":"2026新高考II卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"“我感到惊喜，因为我一直在找哪里能给车充电，”Espinoza在南巴塞罗那一个工人阶层社区赶地铁前说道。"},{"s":"Mia was surprised but smiled gently.","src":"2026北京卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"米娅很惊讶，但温和地笑了。"},{"s":"You may be surprised by what your listeners offer.","src":"2025浙江1月卷·七选五","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"你可能会对听众所提供的（反馈）感到惊讶。"},{"s":"As it has been many years since I last used one, I should hardly be surprised that there are no longer any public telephones near my house.","src":"2024浙江1月卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"由于我上次用公用电话已是多年以前，我家附近不再有任何公用电话，我本不该惊讶。"},{"s":"When Coach Pitt said “Nice work!” to her at the finish line, Eva was surprised.","src":"2024浙江1月卷·书面表达","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"当皮特教练在终点线对她说“干得好！”时，伊娃很惊讶。"},{"s":"However, we worked well together and surprised everyone with our ____47____ on this test I learned so much from my classmates and I realized this was really ____48____ we had partner tests.","src":"2024天津3月卷·阅读Passage 2","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"然而,我们合作得很好, 令大家惊讶的是,在____47____这个测试上,我从同学那里学到了很多东西, 我意识到,这真的是____48____我们进行了伙伴测试。"},{"s":"They were surprised that he had saved some candy and was able to think about the candy during the____32____ .","src":"2023天津6月卷·二、完型填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"他们很惊讶他保存了一些糖____32____果,"},{"s":"Soon after moving to Switzerland, I ____11____(throw) a house-warming party and was greatly surprised when all 30 guests showed up ____12____(exact) on time.","src":"2023北京卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"移居瑞士后不久,我便____11____举办了一个家庭聚餐会,当所有30位客人准时出现时,我____12____感到非常惊讶."},{"s":"When I talk to families as a scholar of higher education, they’re often surprised that teaching excellence is not counted in rankings. ____36____","src":"2023北京卷·七选五","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"我作为高等教育学者与家庭交谈时____36____,"},{"s":"They’re even more surprised at how teaching is undervalued by universities.","src":"2023北京卷·七选五","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"他们对教学被大学低估更感到惊讶。"},{"s":"surprisedD. scared","src":"2021北京卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"吓坏了"},{"s":"As darkness came over the field and the match ended, the goal keeper, Juan, walked over to me and said in a matter-of-fact way, “In your home, do you have a moon too?” I was surprised.","src":"2020江苏卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"当夜幕笼罩球场、比赛结束，守门员胡安走到我面前，用一种就事论事的口气说：“在你们家，也有月亮吗？”我很惊讶。"},{"s":"Why was the author surprised at Juan’s question about the moon?","src":"2020江苏卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"作者为什么对胡安关于月亮的问题感到惊讶？"},{"s":"If so, you may be surprised to learn that libraries have changed for the better.","src":"2020天津6月卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"如果是这样，你可能会惊讶地发现图书馆已经变好了。"},{"s":"Parents are often surprised when teachers suggest their children read magazines.","src":"2018上海卷·Section C","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"当老师建议孩子读杂志时，父母常常感到惊讶。"},{"s":"Why does the man sound surprised?","src":"2017浙江卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"为什么他听起来很惊讶?"},{"s":"When my English teacher stepped into the classroom, I was surprised to see the same man I had met earlier.","src":"外研社B1 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"当我的英语老师走进教室时,我惊讶地看到之前遇到的同一个人."}]},{"def":"to attack, discover, etc., sb suddenly and unexpectedly 出其不意地攻击；使措手不及；无意中发现","ex":[{"s":"Mathematical models have also revealed that food webs may be unstable， where small changes of top predators can lead to big effects throughout entire ecosystems． In the 1960s， scientists proposed that predators at the top of a food web had a surprising amount of control over the size of populations of other species﹣including species they did not directly attack．","src":"2019天津卷·19．","cat":"gaokao","year":2019,"t":"数学模型也揭示，食物网可能不稳定，顶级捕食者的微小变化会在整个生态系统引发巨大效应。20世纪60年代，科学家提出，食物网顶端的捕食者对包括它们不直接攻击的物种在内的其他物种种群规模有着惊人的控制力。"}]}]}